6:  * Phoenix owns the not-elapsed rule, the schedule shape and every lifecycle
7:  * guard, and its 422 problem details are surfaced as they arrive. The only
8:  * schedule knowledge duplicated here is picking a sensible default date for a
9:  * brand-new draft, so opening the sheet cannot immediately fail on an elapsed
10:  * slot.
